    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: October 2026</p>
    
    <h2>1. Data Collection & Privacy First</h2>
    <p>This portfolio website respects your privacy. We do not track personal identifying information, sell user data, or use intrusive third-party marketing cookies. Any inquiries submitted via the AI Assistant or direct contact channels are strictly used for project communication.</p>

    <h2>2. Speech-to-Text & Local AI Processing</h2>
    <p>Voice dictation used in the AI assistant is processed in-memory or via standard browser Web Speech APIs. No raw audio files are stored permanently on our servers.</p>

    <h2>3. Direct Contact</h2>
    <p>If you have any questions regarding your data or project discussions, you can reach out directly via WhatsApp at +880 1823-286674, email at mdsharifmia.dev@gmail.com, or connect via our official YouTube channel at <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@mdsharifmia-dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:#34d399;">@mdsharifmia-dev</a>.</p>
